hadiths[79]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1520","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aurat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai. To Aap ne use hukm diya ke wo Aapki taraf wapas aaey. Us ne kaha: Bataaiye agar main aaun aur tumhey na paaun? Goya wo maut kehti thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum mujhey na paao to Abu Bakr key paas aana. (Bukhari: 3659)"
"1521","[AI-translation] Ammaar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha jabke Aap key sath paanch ghulaamon aur do auraton aur Abu Bakr key siwa koi na tha. (Bukhari: 3660)"
"1522","[AI-translation] Abu Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas baitha tha ke Abu Bakr aey jabke wo apne kapdey ka kinara pakdey huey they yahan tak ke unhon-ne apna ghutna zaahir kar diya tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin tumhaara saathi jhagda kar chuka hai. To us ne salaam kya aur kaha: Merey aur Ibn Khattab key darmiyaan kuchh tha. To main ne uski taraf jaldi ki, phir naadim hua. To us se maanga ke wo mujhey maaf kar dey aur us ne mujh par inkaar kya. To main tumhaari taraf aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah tumhey maaf farmaaey ae Abu Bakr! Teen martaba. Phir Umar naadim huey aur Abu Bakr key ghar aey aur poochha: Kya Abu Bakr yahaan hain? To unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur salaam kya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra badalney laga yahan tak ke Abu Bakr darey. To wo apne ghutnon par jhuk gaey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah ki qasam main zyada zaalim tha. Do martaba. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne mujhey tumhaari taraf bheja. To tum ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha. Aur Abu Bakr ne kaha: Sach kaha. Aur us ne mujh se apni jaan aur apne maal key sath hamdardi ki. To kya tum merey saathi ko merey liye chhorogey? Do martaba. To uskey baad use takleef na di gai. (Bukhari: 3661)"
"1523","[AI-translation] Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use Zaat-us-Salaasil key lashkar par bheja. To main Aap key paas aaya aur main ne kaha: Logon mein sab se mehboob tumhey kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aisha. To main ne kaha: Mardon mein se? To Aap ne farmaya: Uska baap. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Phir Umar bin Khattab. To Aap ne aadmi giney. (Bukhari: 3662)"
"1524","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apna kapda takabbur se ghaseetey to Allah Qiyaamat key din uski taraf na dekhega. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Merey kapdey ka aik kinara dheela ho jaata hai magar ye ke main uska khayaal rakkhun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum wo takabbur se nahi kartey. (Bukhari: 3665)"
"1525","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ashaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne apne ghar mein wuzu kya, phir nikley. To main ne kaha: Main zaroor Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath rahunga aur aaj key din Aap key sath rahunga. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo masjid mein aey aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Wo nikley aur yahaan mutawajjeh huey. To main unkey peechey unkey baarey mein poochhta hua nikla yahan tak ke wo Arees key kuwein mein daakhil huey. To main darwaazey key paas baitha jabke uska darwaaza khajoor ki tehni ka tha yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni haajat poori ki aur wuzu kya. To main Aapki taraf utha aur wo Arees key kuwein par baithey they jabke Aap ne uskey kinarey ka darmiyaan liya hua tha aur apni pindliyon se (kapda) hataaya hua tha aur unhey kuwein mein latkaaya hua tha. To main ne Aap ko salaam kya, phir wapas aaya aur darwaazey key paas baitha. To main ne kaha: Main aaj Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka daarbaan rahunga. To Abu Bakr aey aur unhon-ne darwaaza hilaya. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr. To main ne kaha: Ruko, phir gaya aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye Abu Bakr hain jo ijazat maangtey hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Use ijazat do aur use Jannat ki khushkhabri do. To main aaya yahan tak ke main ne Abu Bakr se kaha: Daakhil ho, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhey Jannat ki khushkhabri detey hain. To Abu Bakr daakhil huey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key daaen taraf Aap key sath kinarey mein baithey. Aur apney pairon ko kuwein mein latkaaya jaisa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya tha aur apni pindliyon se (kapda) hataaya. Phir main wapas aaya aur baitha jabke main apne bhai ko chhor aaya tha jo wuzu kar raha tha aur mujh se milney wala tha. To main ne kaha: Agar Allah fulaan key sath bhalai chaahhey, apne bhai ka iraada kartey huey, to use ley aaey. Phir insaan darwaaza hila raha tha. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To us ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab. To main ne kaha: Ruko. Phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko salaam kya. To main ne kaha: Ye Umar bin Khattab hain jo ijazat maangtey hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Use ijazat do aur use Jannat ki khushkhabri do. To main aaya aur main ne kaha: Daakhil ho, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhey Jannat ki khushkhabri di hai. To wo daakhil huey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath kinarey mein Aap key baaen taraf baithey aur apney pairon ko kuwein mein latkaaya. Phir main wapas aaya aur baitha. To main ne kaha: Agar Allah fulaan key sath bhalai chaahhey to use ley aaey. To insaan aaya jo darwaaza hila raha tha. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To us ne kaha: Usmaan bin Affaan. To main ne kaha: Ruko. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Use ijazat do aur use Jannat ki khushkhabri do, aazmaish par jo use pahunchegi. To main uskey paas aaya aur main ne us se kaha: Daakhil ho, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhey Jannat ki khushkhabri di hai, aazmaish par jo tumhey pahunchegi. To wo daakhil hua aur us ne kinara bhara hua paaya. To wo uskey saamney doosri taraf baitha. (Bukhari: 3674)"
"1526","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey sahaaba ko gaali na do. Phir agar tum mein se koi Uhad jaisa sona kharch karey to wo un mein se kisi key mud ya uskey aadhey ko na pahunchega. (Bukhari: 3673)"
"1527","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Uhad par chadhey jabke Abu Bakr aur Umar aur Usmaan (they). To wo unkey sath hilne laga. To Aap ne farmaya: Thehar jaa ae Uhad! Beshak tum par Nabi aur Siddique aur do shaheed hain. (Bukhari: 3675)"
"1528","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main qaum mein khada tha aur unhon-ne Umar bin Khattab key liye dua ki jabke wo chaarpaai par rakkhey gaey they. Ke merey peechey aik aadmi ne apni kohni merey kandhey par rakkhi jo kehta tha: Allah tum par rehem farmaaey! Beshak main ummeed rakhta tha ke Allah tumhey tumhaarey donon saathiyon key sath kar deyga. Kyunke main aksar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey sunta tha: Main tha aur Abu Bakr aur Umar. Aur main ne kya aur Abu Bakr aur Umar. Aur main chala aur Abu Bakr aur Umar. To beshak main ummeed rakhta tha ke Allah tumhey un donon key sath kar deyga. To main mura aur wo Ali bin Abi Taalib they. (Bukhari: 3677)"
"1529","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne apne aap ko Jannat mein daakhil dekha. Phir main Rumaisa key paas tha jo Abu Talha ki biwi hain. Aur main ne aahat suni. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To us ne kaha: Ye Bilaal hain. Aur main ne mahal dekha jiskay sehan mein londi thi. To main ne kaha: Ye kiska hai? To us ne kaha: Umar ka. To main ne chaaha ke main us mein daakhil hun aur use dekhun, phir mujhey tumhaari ghairat yaad aai. To Umar ne kaha: Merey maan baap tum par qurbaan Ya Rasulullah! Kya main tum par ghairat karunga? (Bukhari: 3679). Saad bin Abi Waqqaas se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangi jabke Aap key paas Quraish mein se auratein thein jo Aap se baat karti thein aur Aap se zyada maangti thein jabke unki aawaazein Aapki aawaaz par buland thein. Phir jab Umar bin Khattab ne ijazat maangi to wo uthen aur pardey ki taraf daudin. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use ijazat di. To Umar daakhil huey jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hans rahey they. To Umar ne kaha: Allah tumhaarey daant hansaaye Ya Rasulullah! To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey un par taajjub hua jo merey paas thein. Phir jab unhon-ne tumhaari aawaaz suni to pardey ki taraf daudin. To Umar ne kaha: Tum zyada haqdaar ho ke wo darein Ya Rasulullah! Phir Umar ne kaha: Ae apni jaanon ki dushmano! Kya tum mujh se darten aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se nahi darten? To unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada sakht aur ghaliz ho. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ruko ae Ibn Khattab! Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Shaitaan tumhey raastey par chalta hua nahi milta magar wo tumhaarey raastey key siwa raasta chalta hai. (3683). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umar apni chaarpaai par rakkhey gaey. To log unhey gheray huey dua kar rahey they aur namaz padh rahey they us se pehley ke wo uthaaye jaatey jabke main un mein tha. To mujhey sirf aadmi ne daraaya jo mera kandha pakdey huey tha. Phir Ali bin Abi Taalib they. To unhon-ne Umar par rehmat ki dua ki aur kaha: Tum ne koi nahi chhora jo mujhey tum se zyada mehboob ho ke main Allah se uskey amal jaisa ley kar milun. Aur Allah ki qasam! Beshak main gumaan karta tha ke Allah tumhey tumhaarey donon saathiyon key sath kar deyga. Aur main samajhta tha ke main aksar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey sunta tha. (3685). Aur us mein ziyaadti hai. Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1530","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Qiyaamat key baarey mein poochha. To us ne kaha: Qiyaamat kab hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aur tum ne uskey liye kya tayyaar kya hai? Us ne kaha: Kuchh nahi magar ye ke main Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat rakhta hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum uskey sath ho jis se tum ne mohabbat rakhi. Anas ne kaha: To ham kisi cheez se itna khush nahi huey jitna Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key qaul (tum uskey sath ho jis se tum ne mohabbat rakhi) se khush huey. Anas ne kaha: To main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar se mohabbat rakhta hun aur ummeed rakhta hun ke main unkey sath hunga apni un se mohabbat se agarchey main ne unkey aamaal jaisa amal nahi kya. (Bukhari: 3688)"
"1531","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum se pehlon mein Bani Israel mein aadmi they jin se baat ki jaati thi baghair iskey ke wo Nabi hon. Phir agar meri ummat mein un mein se koi ho to Umar hai. (Bukhari: 3689)"
"1532","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Misr walon mein se aadmi uskey paas aaya aur us se kaha: Kya tum jaantey ho ke Usmaan Uhad key din bhaagay? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Tum jaantey ho ke wo Badr se ghaaeb rahey aur haazir na huey? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Tum jaantey ho ke wo Baiat-ur-Rizwaan se ghaaeb rahey aur haazir na huey? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Allahu Akbar! Ibn Umar ne kaha: Aao main tumhey wazeh karun. Lekin Uhad key din unka bhaagna to main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ne unhey maaf kar diya aur bakhsh diya. Aur Badr se unka ghaaeb rehna to beshak uskey nikaah mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti thein jo beemaar thein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Beshak tumharey liye us aadmi key ajr jaisa hai jo Badr mein haazir hua aur uska hissa. Aur Baiat-ur-Rizwaan se unka ghaaeb rehna to agar Makkah mein Usmaan se zyada izzat wala koi hota to Aap usey uski jagah bhejtey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Usmaan ko bheja. Aur Baiat-ur-Rizwaan uskey baad thi jab Usmaan Makkah gaey they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne daaen haath se farmaya: Ye Usmaan ka haath hai. To use apne haath par maara aur farmaya: Ye Usmaan key liye hai. To Ibn Umar ne us se kaha: Use ab apne sath ley jao. (Bukhari: 3698)"
"1533","[AI-translation] Ali se riwayat hai ke Faatima (Raziallahu anha) ne chakki key nishaan ki shikaayat ki jo wo paaten. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas qaidi aey. To wo chalen aur Aap ko na paaya. To unhon-ne Aisha ko paaya aur unhey khabar di. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laaey to Aisha ne Aap ko Faatima key aamad ki khabar di. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamaarey paas tashreef laaey jabke ham apne bisteron mein they. To main uthney gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Apni jagah par! To Aap hamaarey darmiyaan baithey yahan tak ke main ne Aap key qadmon ki thandak apne seeney par paai. Aur farmaya: Kya main tumhey us se behtar na sikhaaun jo tum ne mujh se maanga. Jab tum apne bisteron mein jao to chautis martaba takbeer kaho aur taintis martaba tasbeeh kaho aur taintis martaba hamd kaho. To wo tumhaarey liye khaadim se behtar hai. (Bukhari: 3705)"
"1534","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zubair (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Ahzaab key din tha jab mujhey aur Umar bin Abi Salma ko auraton mein rakkha gaya. To main ne dekha ke main Zubair ko apne ghodey par Bani Quraiza ki taraf aatey jaatey huey, do ya teen martaba. Phir jab main wapas aaya to main ne kaha: Ae merey waalid! Main ne tumhey aatey jaatey dekha. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum ne mujhey dekha ae merey betey? Main ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha: Kaun Bani Quraiza key paas jaaeyga aur merey paas unki khabar laaeyga? To main gaya. Phir jab main wapas aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne merey liye apne maan baap jama kiye aur farmaya: Tum par merey maan baap qurbaan! (Bukhari: 3720)"
"1535","[AI-translation] Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath un dinon mein se baaz mein jin mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ladey they, merey aur Saad key siwa na bacha. (Bukhari: 3723)"
"1536","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Talha Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne haath se bachaaya aur us mein maara gaya yahan tak ke wo soon ho gaya. (Bukhari: 3724)"
"1537","[AI-translation] Saad bin Abi Waqqaas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne merey liye Uhad key din apne maan baap jama kiye. (Bukhari: 3725)"
"1538","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Saad Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko suna jabke Aap ne Bani Abd Shams mein se apne damaad ka zikr kya aur uski Aap se rishtedaari mein tareef ki aur achha kaha. Aap ne farmaya: Us ne mujh se baat ki aur sach kaha. Aur mujh se waada kya aur merey liye poora kya. (Bukhari: 3729)"
"1539","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Saad Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko suna jabke Aap ne Bani Abd Shams mein se apne damaad ka zikr kya aur uski Aap se rishtedaari mein tareef ki aur achha kaha. Aap ne farmaya: Us ne mujh se baat ki aur sach kaha. Aur mujh se waada kya aur merey liye poora kya. (Bukhari: 3729)"
"1540","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne lashkar bheja aur un par Usaama bin Zaid ko muqarrar kya. To baaz logon ne uski hukumat mein taana lagaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum uski hukumat mein taana lagaatey ho to tum uskey waalid ki hukumat mein us se pehley taana lagaatey they. Aur Allah ki qasam! Beshak wo hukumat key laeq tha. Aur beshak wo mujhey logon mein sab se mehboob tha. Aur beshak ye uskey baad mujhey logon mein sab se mehboob hai. (Bukhari: 3730)"
"1541","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey paas shanaas aaya jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) gawaah they. Jabke Usaama bin Zaid aur Zaid bin Haaritha letey huey they. To us ne kaha: Beshak ye qadam baaz baaz se hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uskey sath khush huey aur Aap ko achha laga. To Aap ne usey Aisha ko khabar di. (Bukhari: 3731)"
"1542","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Bani Makhzoom mein se aurat ne chori ki. To unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein kaun baat karega? To kisi ne jurrat na ki ke Aap se baat karey. To Usaama bin Zaid ne Aap se baat ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Israel mein jab shareef chori karta to use chhor detey. Aur jab kamzor chori karta to use kaat-tey. Agar Faatima hoti to main uska haath kaatta. (Bukhari: 3733)"
"1543","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) use aur Hasan ko pakadtey aur farmaatey: Ae Allah! Un donon se mohabbat rakkh, beshak main un donon se mohabbat rakhta hun. (Bukhari: 3735)"
"1544","[AI-translation] Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Beshak Abdullah nek aadmi hai. (Bukhari: 3741)"
"1545","[AI-translation] Abu Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Shaam ki masjid mein uskey pehlu mein ladkey key sath baithey. Aur wo keh chuka tha: Ae Allah! Merey liye nek saathi aasaan farma! To Abu Darda ne kaha: Tum kahaan se ho? Us ne kaha: Koofa walon mein se. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum mein ya tum mein raaz wala nahi hai jise uskey siwa koi nahi jaanta? Huzaifa ka iraada kartey huey. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum mein ya tum mein wo nahi hai jise Allah ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zabaan par panaah di? Shaitaan se, yaani Ammaar. Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum mein ya tum mein miswaak aur takiye ya raaz wala nahi hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: Abdullah kaisey padhta tha: (Qasam raat ki jab wo chhaaey aur din ki jab wo roshan ho). Unhon-ne kaha: (Nar aur maada). Unhon-ne kaha: Ye mujh se rahey yahan tak ke wo mujhey us se utaarney lagey jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha. (Bukhari: 3743)"
"1546","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak har ummat ka ameen hai. Aur ae ummat hamaara ameen Abu Ubaida bin Jarraah hai. (Bukhari: 3744)"
"1547","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha jabke Hasan bin Ali Aap key kandhey par they. Aap farma rahey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main us se mohabbat rakhta hun, to tum us se mohabbat rakkho! (Bukhari: 3749)"
"1548","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hasan bin Ali (Raziallahu anhuma) se zyada Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mushaabeh koi na tha. (Bukhari: 3752)"
"1549","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur un se aadmi ne ehraam waley key makkhi maarney key baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Iraq waley makkhi key baarey mein poochhtey hain jabke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti key betey ko qatl kya tha. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo donon duniya mein merey do phool hain. (Bukhari: 3753)"
"1550","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey apne seeney se lagaa liya aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Use hikmat sikha! (Bukhari: 3756)"
"1551","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ae Allah! Use Kitaab sikha! (Bukhari: 3756)"
"1552","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zaid aur Jafar aur Ibn Rawaaha ka sog manaaya. Aur baaqi hadees zikr ki, phir farmaya: To use, yaani jhanday ko, Allah ki talwaaron mein se talwaar ne liya yahan tak ke Allah ne un par fatah di. (Bukhari: 3757)"
"1553","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Quran chaar se seekho: Abdullah bin Masood se, Aap ne us se shuru kya, aur Saalim se jo Abu Huzaifa ka aazaad karda hai aur Ubayy bin Kaab se aur Muaz bin Jabal se. (Bukhari: 3758)"
"1554","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Asma se haar aariyat liya aur wo gum ho gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaaba mein se logon ko uski talaash mein bheja. To unhey namaz ne paa liya aur unhon-ne baghair wuzu namaz padhi. Phir jab wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey to unhon-ne Aap se uski shikaayat ki. To Tayammum ki aayat naazil hui. Phir baaqi hadees zikr ki aur wo Tayammum ki kitaab mein guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 3773)"
"1555","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Buaas ka din wo din tha jo Allah ne apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye pehley karaar diya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laaey jabke unkey sardaar juda ho chukey they aur unkey shareef qatl kiye gaey they aur zakhmi huey they. To Allah ne use apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye unkey Islam mein daakhil honay mein pehley karaar diya tha. (Bukhari: 3777)"
"1556","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Agar hijrat na hoti to main Ansaar mein se aadmi hota. (Bukhari: 3779)"
"1557","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ansaar se momin key siwa mohabbat nahi rakhta aur munaafiq key siwa bugz nahi rakhta. Phir jo un se mohabbat rakkhey to Allah us se mohabbat rakkhey. Aur jo un se bugz rakkhey to Allah us se bugz rakkhey. (Bukhari: 3783)"
"1558","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne auraton aur bachchon ko shaadi se aatey huey dekha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur misal bayan karney lagey. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Tum mujhey logon mein sab se mehboob ho! Aap ne use teen martaba farmaya. (Bukhari: 3785)"
"1559","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ansaar mein se aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai jabke uskey sath uska ladka tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se baat ki aur farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak tum mujhey logon mein sab se mehboob ho! Do martaba. (Bukhari: 3786)"
"1560","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ansaar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Har Nabi key pairwikaar hain aur beshak ham ne tumhaari pairwi ki hai. To Allah se dua kijiye ke wo hamaarey pairwikaaron ko ham mein se kar dey. To Aap ne uskey sath dua ki. (Bukhari: 3787)"
"1561","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Ansaar key gharon mein sab se behtar Bani Najjaar ka ghar hai. Phir Bani Abdul Ashhal ka ghar. Phir Bani Haaris bin Khazraj ka ghar. Phir Bani Saaeda. Aur Ansaar key har gharon mein bhalai hai. To hadees zikr ki aur wo guzar chuki hai. Phir kaha: Saad bin Ubaada ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ansaar key gharon ko muntakhib kya gaya aur hamein aakhir banaaya gaya? To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhaarey liye kaafi nahi hai ke tum behtareen mein se ho. (Bukhari: 3791)"
"1562","[AI-translation] Usaid bin Huzair (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansaar mein se aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum mujhey muqarrar na karogey jaisa tum ne fulaan ko muqarrar kya tha? Aap ne farmaya: Tum merey baad tarjeeh dekhogey. To sabr karo yahan tak ke mujh se Hauz par milo. (Bukhari: 3792)"
"1563","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se aik riwayat mein hai: Aur tumhaara waada Hauz hai. (Bukhari: 3793)"

"1564","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To Aap ne apni biwiyon ki taraf bheja aur unhon-ne kaha: Hamaarey paas paani key siwa kuchh nahi hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaun isey apne sath milaaeyga ya iski mehmaan nawaazi karega? To Ansaar mein se aadmi ne kaha: Main. To wo use apni biwi ki taraf ley gaya. To us ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key mehmaan ki izzat karo. To us ne kaha: Hamaarey paas merey bachchon key khaaney key siwa kuchh nahi hai. To us ne kaha: Apna khaana tayyaar karo aur apna chiraagh subah karo aur apne bachchon ko sula do jab wo raat ka khaana chaahen. To us ne apna khaana tayyaar kya aur apna chiraagh subah kya aur apne bachchon ko sula diya. Phir wo khadi hui goya wo apna chiraagh durust karti hai aur us ne use bujha diya. To wo donon use dikhaaey ke wo donon khaatey hain. To wo donon bhookay raat guzaarey. Phir jab subah hui to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf subah gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Aaj raat Allah hansa ya taajjub kya tum donon key kaam par. To Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Aur wo apne aap par tarjeeh detey hain agarchey unhey haajat ho. Aur jo apne dil ki bakheeli se bachaaya gaya to wahi kaamyaab hain). (Bukhari: 3798)"
"1565","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Abu Bakr aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) Ansaar ki majlison mein se majlis key paas se guzrey jabke wo ro rahey they. To unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey kya rulaata hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ham mein majlis yaad ki. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas daakhil huey aur Aap ko uski khabar di. Unhon-ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley jabke Aap ne apne sar par chaadar ka kinara baandha hua tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap mimbar par chadhey aur us din key baad us par na chadhey. To Allah ki hamd aur sana ki, phir farmaya: Main tumhey Ansaar ki wasiyat karta hun. Beshak wo merey pet aur meri tokri hain. Aur unhon-ne jo un par tha poora kar diya hai aur jo unkey liye hai baaqi raha hai. To unkey nekokaar se qabool karo aur unkey gunaahgaar se darguzar karo. (Bukhari: 3799)"
"1566","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley jabke Aap par chaadar thi jo Aap ne apne kandhon par lapeti hui thi. Aur Aap par gandi patti thi. Yahan tak ke Aap mimbar par baithey. To Allah ki hamd aur sana ki, phir farmaya: Amma baad ae logon! Beshak log bahut hongey aur Ansaar kam hongey yahan tak ke wo khaaney mein namak jaisey hongey. Phir jo tum mein muamley ka wali ho jismein wo kisi ko nuqsaan ya faeda dey to use unkey nekokaar se qabool karna chaahiye aur unkey gunaahgaar se darguzar karna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 3800)"
"1567","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rehman ka Arsh Saad bin Muaz ki maut par hila. (Bukhari: 3803)"
"1568","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ubayy se farmaya: Beshak Allah ne mujhey hukm diya hai ke main tum par (Wo jinhon-ne kufr kya Kitaab walon mein se) padhun. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur us ne mera naam liya? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. To wo roey. (Bukhari: 3809)"
"1569","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein chaar ne Quran jama kya tha. Wo sab Ansaar mein se they: Ubayy aur Muaz bin Jabal aur Abu Zaid aur Zaid bin Saabit. Main ne Anas se kaha: Abu Zaid kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Merey chachaon mein se aik. (Bukhari: 3810)"
"1570","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Uhad ka din tha to log Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bhaagay. Jabke Abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key saamney they jabke wo Aap par apni dhaal se jhukay huey they. Aur Abu Talha teerandaaz aadmi they jo sakht kheench waley they. Us din do ya teen kamanen toden. Aur aadmi teeron ka tarqash ley kar guzarta to Aap farmaatey: Use Abu Talha key liye bikhair do. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qaum ko dekhney key liye zaahir huey. To Abu Talha kehtey: Ae Allah key Nabi! Merey maan baap tum par qurbaan! Zaahir na ho, tumhey qaum key teeron mein se teer lagega. Mera seena tumharey seeney key siwa hai. Aur main ne Aisha bint Abi Bakr aur Umm Sulaim ko dekha jabke wo donon apne kapdey uthaaye huey thein. Main unki pindliyon key zewar dekhta tha. Wo apni peethon par mashkeezein utha kar laaten aur qaum key munhon mein undel ten. Phir wapas jaaten aur unhey bhar ten. Phir aaten aur qaum key munhon mein undel ten. Aur Abu Talha key donon haathon se talwaar giri, ya do martaba ya teen martaba. (Bukhari: 3811)"
"1571","[AI-translation] Saad bin Abi Waqqaas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zameen par chalne waley kisi key liye farmatey huey nahi suna ke wo Jannat walon mein se hai magar Abdullah bin Salaam key liye. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur uskey baarey mein ye aayat naazil hui: (Aur Bani Israel mein se gawaah ne us jaisey par gawahi di). (Bukhari: 3812)"
"1572","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein khwaab dekha aur use Aap ko sunaaya. Aur main ne dekha goya main baagh mein hun, uski kushaadgi aur sabzey ka zikr kya, uskey darmiyaan lohey ka sutoon hai jiska neechey zameen mein hai aur uska upar aasmaan mein hai. Uskay upar kunda hai. To mujh se kaha gaya: Chadho. Main ne kaha: Main taaqat nahi rakhta. To merey paas khaadim aaya aur us ne merey kapdey peechey se uthaaey aur main chadha yahan tak ke main uskey upar tha. To main ne kunday ko pakad liya. To us se kaha gaya: Mazboot pakdo. To main jaaga jabke wo merey haath mein tha. To main ne use Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sunaaya. Aap ne farmaya: Wo baagh Islam hai. Aur wo sutoon Islam ka sutoon hai. Aur wo kunda mazboot kunda hai. To tum Islam par ho yahan tak ke maro. (Bukhari: 3813)"
"1573","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyon mein se kisi par itni ghairat nahi ki jitni Khadija par ghairat ki. Aur main ne unhey dekha nahi. Lekin Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unka bahut zikr kartey they. Aur baaz auqaat bakri zibah kartey, phir use tukdon mein kaat-tey, phir use Khadija ki saheliyon mein bhejtey. To baaz auqaat main Aap se kehti: Goya duniya mein Khadija key siwa aurat na thi. To Aap farmaatey: Beshak wo aisi thein aur aisi thein. Aur merey liye un se aulaad thi. (Bukhari: 3818)"
"1574","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jibreel Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye Khadija aaein hain jabke unkey sath bartan hai jismein saalan ya khaana ya peena hai. Phir jab wo tumhaarey paas aaein to unhey unkey Rab se aur meri taraf se salaam kehna. Aur unhey Jannat mein motiyon key ghar ki khushkhabri dena jismein shor nahi hai aur na thakaan. (Bukhari: 3820)"
"1575","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Khadija ki behan Haala bint Khuwailid ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangi. To Aap ne Khadija key ijazat maangney ko pehchaana aur uskey liye ghabraaey. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Haala! Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne ghairat ki. To main ne kaha: Tum Quraish ki budhiyon mein se budhiya ka kya zikr kartey ho jo surkh masoodhon wali thi jo zamaaney mein halaak hui. Allah ne tumhey us se behtar dey di hai. (Bukhari: 3821)"
"1576","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hind bint Utba aaein. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Zameen ki peeth par khe mey walon mein se merey paas tumharey khe mey walon key zaleel honay se zyada mehboob koi na tha. Phir aaj zameen ki peeth par khe mey waley merey paas tumharey khe mey walon key izzat paaney se zyada mehboob koi nahi hai. Aap ne farmaya: Aur phir, qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Aur baaqi hadees guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 3825)"
"1577","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail se Baldah key neechey milay, us se pehley ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahi naazil ho. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key saamney dastarkhwaan rakha gaya aur Aap ne us mein se khaaney se inkaar kar diya. Phir Zaid ne kaha: Beshak main us mein se nahi khaata jo tum apne buton par zibah kartey ho. Aur main sirf wo khaata hun jis par Allah ka naam liya gaya ho. Aur Zaid bin Amr Quraish key zabeehon par aib lagaata tha aur kehta tha: Bakri ko Allah ne paida kya hai aur uskey liye aasmaan se paani utaara hai aur uskey liye zameen se (ghaas) ugaaee hai. Phir tum use Allah key naam key siwa par zibah kartey ho. Uska inkaar kartay huey aur usey bada samajhtey huey. (Bukhari: 3826)"
"1578","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Jo qasam khaaney wala ho to wo Allah key siwa qasam na khaey. To Quraish apne baapon ki qasam khaatey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Apne baapon ki qasam na khaao. (Bukhari: 3836)"
"1579","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab se sachi baat jo shaaer ne kahi Labeed ki baat hai: Khabardaar! Allah key siwa har cheez baatil hai. Aur qareeb tha ke Umayya bin Abis Salt Musalman ho jaata. (Bukhari: 3841). Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Abdul Muttalib bin Haashim bin Abd Manaaf bin Qusayy bin Kilaab bin Murra bin Kaab bin Luayy bin Ghaalib bin Fihr bin Maalik bin Nazr bin Kinaana bin Khuzaima bin Mudrika bin Ilyaas bin Muzar bin Nizaar bin Maad bin Adnaan ki besat ka baab."
"1580","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par naazil hua jab Aap chaalees saal key they. To Aap Makkah mein tairaah saal rahey. Phir Aap ko hijrat ka hukm diya gaya aur Aap Madina ki taraf hijrat kar gaey. To Aap us mein das saal rahey. Phir Aap faut ho gaey (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam). (Bukhari: 3851)"
"1581","[AI-translation] Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya ke mushrikeen ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath sab se sakht kya kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Kaaba key hijr mein namaz padh rahey they ke Uqba bin Abi Muait aaya aur us ne apna kapda Aapki gardan mein rakkha aur Aap ka sakht gala ghonta. To Abu Bakr aey yahan tak ke unhon-ne uska kandha pakda aur use Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hata diya. Unhon-ne kaha: (Kya tum aadmi ko qatl kartey ho ke wo kehta hai ke mera Rab Allah hai) aayat. (Bukhari: 3856)"
"1582","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Aap key wuzu aur haajat key liye bartan uthaatey they. Wo guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein Aap key qaul ka izaafa kya: Beshak merey paas Naseebain key jinnon ka wafd aaya. Aur achhey jinn. To unhon-ne mujh se tosha maanga. To main ne Allah se unkey liye dua ki ke wo haddi aur na guzrein aur na leed, magar us par khaana paaein. (Bukhari: 3860)"
"1583","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur un se poochha gaya: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jinnon key baarey mein kis ne khabar di thi jis raat unhon-ne Quran suna tha? To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak unhey darkht ne khabar di thi. (Bukhari: 3859)"
"1584","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Aap key wuzu aur haajat key liye bartan uthaatey they. Wo guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein Aap key qaul ka izaafa kya: Beshak merey paas Naseebain key jinnon ka wafd aaya. Aur achhey jinn. To unhon-ne mujh se tosha maanga. To main ne Allah se unkey liye dua ki ke wo haddi aur na guzrein aur na leed, magar us par khaana paaein. (Bukhari: 3860)"
"1585","[AI-translation] Khaalid ki beti Umm Khaalid (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Habsha ki zameen se aai jabke main chhoti ladki thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey nishaan wali chaadar pehnaai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne haath se nishaan maltey aur farmaatey: Sana sana! (Bukhari: 3874)"
"1586","[AI-translation] Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Tum ne apne chacha key liye kya faeda diya jabke wo tumhaari hifaazat karta tha aur tumharey liye ghussa karta tha? Aap ne farmaya: Wo aag key uthley hissey mein hai. Aur agar main na hota to wo aag key nichley darjey mein hota. (Bukhari: 3883)"
"1587","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko suna jabke Aap key paas Aap key chacha ka zikr kya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Shayed Qiyaamat key din meri sifaarish use faeda deygi. To use aag key uthley hissey mein rakkha jaaeyga jo uskey takhnon tak pahunchegi jis se uska dimaagh ubhlega. (Bukhari: 3885)"
"1588","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab Quraish ne mujhey jhutlaaya to main Hijr mein khada hua. To Allah ne merey liye Bait-ul-Maqdis ko zaahir kar diya. To main unhey uski nishaaniyon ki khabar denay laga jabke main usey dekh raha tha. (Bukhari: 3886). Isra aur Meraj ki hadees."
"1589","[AI-translation] Maalik bin Saasa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey us raat ki hadees sunaai jab Aap ko seyr karaai gai: Jabke main Hateem mein, aur baaz auqaat farmaya: Hijr mein, leta hua tha ke merey paas aaney wala aaya aur us ne phaada. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main ne use kehtey huey suna. To us ne is se is tak cheera. Raawi ne kaha: Uskey halq key gadhey se uskey seeney key baal tak. To mera dil nikaala. Phir merey paas sonay ka tasht laaya gaya jo imaan se bhara hua tha. To mera dil dhoya gaya, phir bhara gaya, phir wapas kya gaya. Phir merey paas sawaari laai gai jo khachchar se chhoti aur gadhey se badi, safed thi. Raawi ne kaha: Wo Buraaq hai. Wo apna qadam apne kinarey par rakhta hai. To mujhey us par sawaar kya gaya. To Jibreel mujhey ley kar chaley yahan tak ke neechey waley aasmaan mein aey. To us ne kholney ko kaha. To kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Aur tumharey sath kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Aur kya use bheja gaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Kaha gaya: Use khush aamdeed! Kya hi achhi aamad aai hai. To us ne khola. Phir jab main khaalis hua to us mein Aadam they. To us ne kaha: Ye tumhaarey waalid Aadam hain, unhey salaam karo. To main ne unhey salaam kya. To unhon-ne salaam ka jawaab diya, phir kaha: Nek betey aur nek Nabi ko khush aamdeed! Phir mujhey ley kar chadhey yahan tak ke doosrey aasmaan mein aey. To us ne kholney ko kaha. Kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Aur tumharey sath kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Aur kya use bheja gaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Kaha gaya: Use khush aamdeed! Kya hi achhi aamad aai hai. To us ne khola. Phir jab main khaalis hua to Yahya aur Isa they jabke wo donon khaala zaad hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Yahya aur Isa hain, unhey salaam karo. To main ne salaam kya aur unhon-ne jawaab diya, phir kaha: Nek bhai aur nek Nabi ko khush aamdeed! Phir mujhey teesrey aasmaan ki taraf ley kar chadhey. To us ne kholney ko kaha. Kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Aur tumharey sath kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Aur kya use bheja gaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Kaha gaya: Use khush aamdeed! Kya hi achhi aamad aai hai. To khola gaya. Phir jab main khaalis hua to Yusuf they. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Yusuf hain, unhey salaam karo. To main ne unhey salaam kya. To unhon-ne jawaab diya, phir kaha: Nek bhai aur nek Nabi ko khush aamdeed! Phir mujhey ley kar chadhey yahan tak ke chauthey aasmaan mein aey. To us ne kholney ko kaha. Kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Aur tumharey sath kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Kya use bheja gaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Kaha gaya: Use khush aamdeed! Kya hi achhi aamad aai hai. To khola gaya. Phir jab main Idrees tak khaalis hua to kaha: Ye Idrees hain, unhey salaam karo. To main ne unhey salaam kya. To unhon-ne jawaab diya, phir kaha: Nek bhai aur nek Nabi ko khush aamdeed! Phir mujhey ley kar chadhey yahan tak ke paanchween aasmaan mein aey. To us ne kholney ko kaha. Kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Aur tumharey sath kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Aur kya use bheja gaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Kaha gaya: Use khush aamdeed! Kya hi achhi aamad aai hai. Phir jab main khaalis hua to Haaroon they. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Haaroon hain, unhey salaam karo. To main ne unhey salaam kya. To unhon-ne jawaab diya, phir kaha: Nek bhai aur nek Nabi ko khush aamdeed! Phir mujhey ley kar chadhey yahan tak ke chhatey aasmaan mein aey. To us ne kholney ko kaha. Kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Tumharey sath kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Aur kya use bheja gaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Use khush aamdeed! Kya hi achhi aamad aai hai. Phir jab main khaalis hua to Musa they. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Musa hain, unhey salaam karo. To main ne unhey salaam kya aur unhon-ne jawaab diya, phir kaha: Nek bhai aur nek Nabi ko khush aamdeed! Phir jab main aagey badha to wo roey. Us se kaha gaya: Tumhey kya rulaata hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Main isliye rota hun ke ladka jo merey baad bheja gaya uski ummat mein se Jannat mein daakhil honay waley zyada hain un se jo meri ummat mein se us mein daakhil hotey hain. Phir mujhey saatween aasmaan ki taraf ley kar chadhey. To Jibreel ne kholney ko kaha. Kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Aur tumharey sath kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Aur kya use bheja gaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Use khush aamdeed! Kya hi achhi aamad aai hai. Phir jab main khaalis hua to Ibrahim they. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye tumhaarey waalid hain, unhey salaam karo. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne unhey salaam kya. To unhon-ne salaam ka jawaab diya. Unhon-ne kaha: Nek betey aur nek Nabi ko khush aamdeed! Phir merey liye Sidrat-ul-Muntaha uthaaee gai. Phir uska phal Hajar key matkon jaisa tha. Aur uska patta haathi key kaanon jaisa tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Sidrat-ul-Muntaha hai. Aur chaar nehrein: Do chhupi huin aur do zaahir. To main ne kaha: Ae Jibreel ye do kya hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Lekin chhupi huin Jannat mein do nehrein hain. Aur zaahir to Neel aur Furaat hain. Phir merey liye Bait-ul-Mamoor uthaaya gaya. Phir merey paas sharaab ka bartan aur doodh ka bartan aur shehed ka bartan laaya gaya. To main ne doodh liya. To us ne kaha: Wo fitrat hai jis par tum ho aur tumhaari ummat. Phir mujh par namazein farz ki gaein, har din pachaas namazein. To main wapas aaya aur Musa par se guzra. To unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey kis ka hukm diya gaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey har din pachaas namazon ka hukm diya gaya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tumhaari ummat har din pachaas namazon ki taaqat nahi rakhti. Aur beshak main ne Allah ki qasam tum se pehley logon ko aazmaaya hai aur Bani Israel ka sakht ilaaj kya hai. To apne Rab ki taraf wapas jao aur apni ummat key liye takhfeef maango. To main wapas aaya aur us ne mujh se das kam kar diye. To main Musa ki taraf wapas aaya aur us ne waisa kaha. To main wapas aaya aur us ne mujh se das kam kar diye. To main Musa ki taraf wapas aaya aur us ne waisa kaha. To main wapas aaya aur us ne mujh se das kam kar diye. To main Musa ki taraf wapas aaya aur us ne waisa kaha. To main wapas aaya aur mujhey har din das namazon ka hukm diya gaya. To main wapas aaya aur us ne waisa kaha. To main wapas aaya aur mujhey har din paanch namazon ka hukm diya gaya. To main Musa ki taraf wapas aaya. To us ne kaha: Tumhey kis ka hukm diya gaya? Main ne kaha: Mujhey har din paanch namazon ka hukm diya gaya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tumhaari ummat har din paanch namazon ki taaqat nahi rakhti. Aur beshak main ne tum se pehley logon ko aazmaaya hai aur Bani Israel ka sakht ilaaj kya hai. To apne Rab ki taraf wapas jao aur apni ummat key liye takhfeef maango. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne apne Rab se maanga yahan tak ke main sharmaaya. Lekin main raazi hun aur salaam karta hun. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab main aagey badha to pukaarne waley ne pukaara: Main ne apna farz poora kar diya aur apne bandon se takhfeef kar di. Aur Isra ki hadees Anas se namaaz ki kitaab key shuru mein guzar chuki hai. Aur un mein har aik mein wo hai jo doosrey mein nahi hai. (Bukhari: 3887)"
"1590","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Allah Taala key qaul (Aur ham ne jo khwaab tumhey dikhaaya use logon key liye aazmaish key siwa nahi banaaya) key baarey mein riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Wo aankh ka khwaab hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us raat dikhaaya gaya jab Aap ko Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf seyr karaai gai. Unhon-ne kaha: (Aur Quran mein maloon darkht). Unhon-ne kaha: Wo Zaqqoom ka darkht hai. (Bukhari: 3888)"
"1591","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se nikaah kya jab main chhe saal ki thi. To ham Madina aey aur Bani Haaris bin Khazraj mein utrey. To mujhey bukhaar hua aur merey baal jhad gaey aur kandhon tak aey. To meri waalida Umm Roomaan merey paas aaein jabke main jhule mein thi aur merey sath meri saheliyaan thein. To unhon-ne mujhey cheekh kar bulaaya. To main unkey paas aai jabke mujhey nahi maloom tha ke wo mujh se kya chaahten. To unhon-ne mera haath pakda yahan tak ke mujhey ghar key darwaazey par khada kar diya jabke main haanp rahi thi yahan tak ke mera saans thama. Phir unhon-ne thoda paani liya aur us se mera chehra aur mera sar ponchha, phir mujhey ghar mein daakhil kya. Phir Ansaar ki auratein ghar mein thein. To unhon-ne kaha: Bhalai aur barkat par aur achhey naseeb par! To unhon-ne mujhey unkey supurd kar diya aur unhon-ne mera muamla durust kya. To mujhey sirf Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne daraaya Chaasht key waqt. To unhon-ne mujhey Aap key supurd kar diya jabke main us din nau saal ki thi. (Bukhari: 3894)"
"1592","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum mujhey khwaab mein do martaba dikhaai gaein. Main dekhta hun ke tum resham key tukdey mein ho. Aur wo kehta hai: Ye tumhaari biwi hai, to use khol do. Phir wo tum ho. To main kehta hun: Agar ye Allah ki taraf se ho to use poora karega. (Bukhari: 3895). Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba ki Madina ki taraf hijrat."
"1593","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne apne maan baap ko kabhi na samjha magar ye ke wo deen ki pairwi kartey they. Aur ham par din na guzarta magar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) din key donon kinaron subah aur shaam hamaarey paas aatey. Phir jab Musalman aazmaaey gaey to Abu Bakr Habsha ki zameen ki taraf hijrat kar key nikley. Yahan tak ke jab wo Bark-ul-Ghimaad tak pahunchay to unhey Ibn Dagina mila jo Qaara ka sardaar tha. To us ne kaha: Ae Abu Bakr tum kahaan chaaahtey ho? To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Meri qaum ne mujhey nikaal diya hai. To main chahta hun ke zameen mein siyaahat karun aur apne Rab ki ibaadat karun. Ibn Dagina ne kaha: Beshak tum jaisa ae Abu Bakr na nikalta hai aur na nikaala jaata hai. Beshak tum naadaar ko kama kar detey ho aur rishtedaari jodtey ho aur bojh uthaatey ho aur mehmaan nawaazi kartey ho aur haq ki museebaton mein madad kartey ho. To main tumhaara padosi hun. Wapas jao aur apne shehar mein apne Rab ki ibaadat karo. To wo wapas aey aur Ibn Dagina unkey sath kooch kar gaya. To Ibn Dagina shaam ko Quraish key sardaaron mein ghuma aur un se kaha: Beshak Abu Bakr jaisa na nikalta hai aur na nikaala jaata hai. Kya tum aadmi ko nikaaltey ho jo naadaar ko kama kar deta hai aur rishtedaari jodta hai aur bojh uthaata hai aur mehmaan nawaazi karta hai aur haq ki museebaton mein madad karta hai? To Quraish ne Ibn Dagina key pados ko nahi jhutlaaya. Aur unhon-ne Ibn Dagina se kaha: Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo apne ghar mein apne Rab ki ibaadat karey. To wo us mein namaz padhey aur jo chaahey padhey. Aur hamein uskey sath takleef na dey aur use zaahir na karey. Beshak ham dartey hain ke wo hamaari auraton aur hamaarey beton ko fitney mein daaleyga. To Ibn Dagina ne wo Abu Bakr se kaha. To Abu Bakr uskey sath thehrey aur apne ghar mein apne Rab ki ibaadat kartey aur apni namaz ko zaahir na kartey aur na apne ghar key siwa padhtey. Phir Abu Bakr ko khayaal aaya aur unhon-ne apne ghar key sehan mein masjid banaai. Aur wo us mein namaz padhtey aur Quran padhtey. To un par mushrikeen ki auratein aur unkey betey toot padtey jabke wo us se taajjub kartey aur usey dekhtey. Aur Abu Bakr ronay waley aadmi they, apni aankhon par qaabu na rakhtey they jab Quran padhtey. Aur wo mushrikeen mein se Quraish key sardaaron ko daraata tha. To unhon-ne Ibn Dagina ki taraf bheja aur wo unkey paas aaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak ham ne Abu Bakr ko tumhaarey pados key sath panaah di thi ke wo apne ghar mein apne Rab ki ibaadat karey. To us ne us se tajawuz kya hai aur us ne apne ghar key sehan mein masjid banaai hai. To us ne us mein namaz aur qiraat ko zaahir kya hai. Aur beshak ham dartey hain ke wo hamaari auraton aur hamaarey beton ko fitney mein daaleyga. To use mana karo. Phir agar wo pasand karey ke wo us par iktifa karey ke wo apne ghar mein apne Rab ki ibaadat karey to karey. Aur agar wo inkaar karey magar ye ke wo use zaahir karey to us se maango ke wo tumhey tumhaara zimma wapas kar dey. Beshak ham ne naapasand kya hai ke ham tumhey dhoka dein. Aur ham Abu Bakr key zaahir karney ko manzoor nahi kartey. Aisha ne kaha: To Ibn Dagina Abu Bakr key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Tum jaan chukey ho jo main ne tumhaarey liye muaahida kya tha. Phir ya to us par iktifa karo ya mujhey mera zimma wapas karo. Beshak main pasand nahi karta ke Arab suney ke main dhoka diya gaya hun aadmi key baarey mein jiskay liye main ne muaahida kya tha. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Beshak main tumhey tumhaara pados wapas karta hun aur Allah Azza wa Jall key pados par raazi hun. Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us din Makkah mein they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Musalmaanon se farmaya: Beshak mujhey tumhaari hijrat ki jagah dikhaai gai hai: Khajooron wali jo do kinaron key darmiyaan hai. Aur wo donon Harra hain. To jo hijrat karney wala tha Madina ki taraf hijrat kar gaya. Aur aam jo Habsha ki zameen ki taraf hijrat kar chuka tha Madina ki taraf wapas aaya. Aur Abu Bakr Madina ki taraf tayyaar huey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Ruko, beshak mujhey ummeed hai ke mujhey ijazat di jaaeygi. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Aur kya tum ummeed rakhtey ho, merey maan baap tum par qurbaan? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. To Abu Bakr ne apne aap ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par rok liya taake Aap ki sohbat karey. Aur do oontniyaan jo uskey paas thein unhey keekar key pattey khilaaey. Aur wo khabt hai, chaar mahiney. Aisha ne kaha: Phir jabke ham aik din Abu Bakr key ghar mein dopahar key waqt baithey they ke Abu Bakr se kehney waley ne kaha: Ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain jo munh dhaanpey huey hain, us waqt mein jo Aap hamaarey paas nahi aatey they. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Un par merey maan baap qurbaan! Allah ki qasam Aap ko is waqt koi muamla key siwa nahi laaya. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laaey aur ijazat maangi. To Aap ko ijazat di gai aur Aap daakhil huey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Bakr se farmaya: Jo tumharey paas hain unhey nikaalo. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Wo tumhaarey ghar waley hain, merey maan baap tum par qurbaan Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Beshak mujhey nikalney ki ijazat di gai hai. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Sohbat, merey maan baap tum par qurbaan Ya Rasulullah! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan. Abu Bakr ne kaha: To lo, merey maan baap tum par qurbaan, Ya Rasulullah meri in donon oontniyon mein se aik! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qeemat key sath. Aisha ne kaha: To ham ne unhey tez tayyaari key sath tayyaar kya. Aur ham ne unkey liye thaili mein tosha banaaya. To Asma bint Abi Bakr ne apne kamarband ka tukda kaata aur us se thaili ka munh baandha. To isliye unka naam Zaat-un-Nitaaqain pada. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr Saur key pahaad mein ghaar se jaa milay. To us mein teen raatein chhupay rahey. Un donon key paas Abdullah bin Abi Bakr raat guzaarta tha. Jabke wo jawaan ladka tez samajh wala tha. To wo un donon key paas se subah key waqt nikalta. To wo subah Quraish key sath Makkah mein raat guzaarney waley jaisa hota. To wo koi muamla na sunta jiskey sath un donon key khilaaf chaal chali jaati magar use yaad rakhta yahan tak ke wo un donon key paas uski khabar ley kar aata jab andhera milta. Aur un donon par Aamir bin Fuhaira jo Abu Bakr ka aazaad karda tha doodh waley bakriyon ka rewad charta tha. To use un donon par wapas laata jab Isha ki ghadi guzarti. To wo donon taaza doodh mein raat guzaartey. Aur wo un donon key doodh waley janwaron ka doodh aur pathar par garam kya hua (doodh) tha. Yahan tak ke Aamir bin Fuhaira use subah andherey mein haankta. Wo un teen raaton mein har raat aisa karta. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr ne Bani Deel mein se aadmi ko mazdoori par rakha. Jabke wo Bani Abd bin Adi mein se tha. Raasta jaan-ney wala maahir. Aur maahir raasta jaan-ney wala hai. Us ne Aas bin Wael Sahmi key khaandaan mein half kya hua tha. Jabke wo Quraish key kaafiron key deen par tha. To unhon-ne use aman di aur unhon-ne use apni donon oontniyaan dein aur us se Saur key ghaar ka teen raaton key baad apni donon oontniyon key sath teesri ki subah waada kya. Aur un donon key sath Aamir bin Fuhaira aur raahnuma chala. To us ne unhey samandaron key raastey par liya. Suraaqa bin Joasham Mudliji (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Wo kehta hai: Hamaarey paas Quraish key kaafiron key bhejaney waley aey jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr mein diyat rakhtey they, un mein se har aik ki jo use qatl karey ya qaidi banaaey. Phir jabke main apni qaum Bani Mudlij ki majlison mein se majlis mein baitha tha ke un mein se aadmi aaya yahan tak ke wo ham par khada hua jabke ham baithey they. To us ne kaha: Ae Suraaqa! Beshak main ne abhi samandar par saaye dekhey hain. Main unhey Muhammad aur uskey sahaaba samajhta hun. Suraaqa ne kaha: To main ne jaan liya ke wo wahi hain. To main ne us se kaha: Beshak wo wahi nahi hain. Lekin tum ne fulaan aur fulaan ko dekha hai jo hamaari aankhon key saamney gaey hain. Phir main majlis mein ghadi bhar thehra. Phir utha aur daakhil hua. To main ne apni londi ko hukm diya ke wo mera ghoda nikaaley jabke wo teelay key peechey hai. To use merey liye rok rakkhey. Aur main ne apna nezah liya aur use ghar key peechey se nikaala. To main ne uski noch se zameen khodi aur uskey upar neecha kya yahan tak ke main apne ghodey key paas aaya aur us par sawaar hua. To main ne use daudaaya jo mujhey qareeb karta tha. Yahan tak ke main un se qareeb hua aur mera ghoda merey sath thokar khaaya aur main us se gir pada. To main utha aur apna haath apne tarqash ki taraf badhaaya. To us mein se teer nikaaley aur unkey sath qismat aazmaaee: Kya main unhey nuqsaan pahunchaaun ya nahi. To wo nikla jo main naapasand karta tha. To main apne ghodey par sawaar hua aur teeron ki naafarmaani ki. Wo mujhey qareeb karta tha. Yahan tak ke jab main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qiraat suni jabke Aap tawajjeh nahi kartey they. Aur Abu Bakr bahut tawajjeh kartey they. To merey ghodey key donon haath zameen mein dhans gaey yahan tak ke ghutnon tak pahunch gaey. To main us se gir pada. Phir main ne use haanka aur wo utha. To wo apne donon haath mushkil se nikaal saka. Phir jab wo khada ho gaya to uskey donon haathon key nishaan par aasmaan mein dhuein jaisa roshan gubaar tha. To main ne teeron se qismat aazmaai aur wo nikla jo main naapasand karta tha. To main ne unhey aman se pukaara. To wo rukay aur main apne ghodey par sawaar hua yahan tak ke main unkey paas aaya. Aur merey dil mein pada jab main ne wo paaya jo un se rokey jaaney mein paaya tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka muamla zaroor zaahir hoga. To main ne us se kaha: Beshak tumhaari qaum ne tum mein diyat rakkhi hai. Aur main ne unhey unki khabrein bataaein jo log unkey sath chaaahtey hain. Aur main ne unhey tosha aur saamaan pesh kya. To unhon-ne mujh se kami na ki aur na mujh se maanga. Magar ye ke (Aap ne) farmaya: Ham se chhupaao. To main ne us se maanga ke wo merey liye aman ki kitaab likhey. To us ne Aamir bin Fuhaira ko hukm diya aur us ne chamdey key tukdey mein likha. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaley aur Aap Zubair se milay jo Musalmaanon key qaafiley mein they jo taajir they jo Shaam se wapas aatey huey they. To Zubair ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr ko safed kapdey pehnaae. Aur Madina mein Musalmaanon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key Makkah se nikalney ko suna. To wo har subah Harra ki taraf subah jaatey aur Aap ka intezaar kartey yahan tak ke unhey dopahar ki garmi wapas karti. To wo aik din wapas aey jab unhon-ne apna intezaar lamba kya. Phir jab wo apne gharon ki taraf aey to Yahood mein se aadmi unkey teelon mein se teelay par muamley key liye chadha jise wo dekhta tha. To us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba ko safed kapdon mein dekha jinhey reet hataati thi. To Yahoodi apne aap par qaabu na rakh saka ke us ne buland aawaaz se kaha: Ae Arbon ki jamaat! Ye tumhaara naseeb hai jiska tum intezaar kartey ho. To Musalman hathiyaar ki taraf uthay. To unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka Harra ki peeth par isteqbaal kya. To Aap ne unhey daaen taraf mor diya yahan tak ke Aap unhey Bani Amr bin Auf mein utaaray. Aur wo Rabi-ul-Awwal key mahiney mein Peer ka din tha. To Abu Bakr logon key liye khadey huey. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khaamosh baithey. To Ansaar mein se jo aaya, jinhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko nahi dekha tha, Abu Bakr ko salaam karta. Yahan tak ke dhoop Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko lagi. To Abu Bakr aey yahan tak ke Aap par apni chaadar se saaya kya. To logon ne us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pehchaana. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bani Amr bin Auf mein pandrah raatein thehrey. Aur masjid ki bunyaad rakkhi gai jo taqwa par bunyaad rakkhi gai thi. Aur us mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. Phir Aap ne apni oontni par sawaari ki. To Aap chaley jabke log Aap key sath paidal chal rahey they yahan tak ke wo Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Madina mein masjid key paas baithi. Jabke wo us mein us din Musalmaanon mein se aadmi namaz padhtey they. Aur wo Suhail aur Sahl, jo Saad bin Zuraara ki parwarish mein yateem ladkey they, ki khajoor sukh aaney ki jagah thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jab Aapki oontni Aap sey baithi: Ye agar Allah ne chaaha thikaana hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne donon ladkon ko bulaaya aur un se jagah ka mol bhaao kya taake use masjid banaaein. To unhon-ne kaha: Nahi, balke ham use tumhey tohfey mein detey hain Ya Rasulullah! To Rasulullah ne un donon se tohfey mein qabool karney se inkaar kya yahan tak ke use un donon se khareed liya. Phir use masjid banaaya. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey sath uski tameer mein eentein uthaane lagey. Aur farmaatey jab eentein uthaatey: Ye bojh Khaibar key bojh nahi hai. Ye hamaarey Rab zyada nek aur paak hai. Aur farmaatey: Ae Allah! Beshak ajr aakhirat ka ajr hai. To Ansaar aur Muhaajireen par rehem farma! (Bukhari: 3905-3906)"
"1594","[AI-translation] Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo Abdullah bin Zubair se haamla thein. Unhon-ne kaha: To main nikli jabke main poorey dinon se thi. To main Madina aai aur Quba mein utri aur main ne use Quba mein jana. Phir main use Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas laai aur Aapki god mein rakkha. Phir Aap ne khajoor maangi aur use chabaaya, phir uskey munh mein thooka. To pehli cheez jo uskey pet mein daakhil hui wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka luaab tha. Phir use khajoor se tehneek ki, phir uskey liye dua ki aur us par barkat ki. Aur wo pehla bachcha tha jo Islam mein paida hua. (Bukhari: 3909)"
"1595","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghaar mein tha. To main ne apna sar uthaaya aur main qaum key qadmon key paas tha. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Agar un mein se koi apni nigaah jhukaaey to hamein dekh ley. Aap ne farmaya: Khaamosh raho ae Abu Bakr! Do hain jinka teesra Allah hai. (Bukhari: 3922)"
"1596","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamaarey paas sab se pehley Musab bin Umair aur Ibn Umm Maktoom aey. Aur wo donon logon ko padhaatey they. To Bilaal aur Saad aur Ammaar bin Yaasir aey. Phir Umar bin Khattab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se bees mein aey. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laaey. To main ne Madina walon ko kisi cheez se itna khush nahi dekha jitna Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khush huey. Yahan tak ke londiyaan kehney lagein: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laaey! To Aap tashreef na laaey yahan tak ke main ne (Sabbihisma Rabbikal Aala) Mufassal ki surton mein padhi. (Bukhari: 3925)"
"1597","[AI-translation] Alaa bin Hazrami (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Muhaajir key liye wapas jaaney key baad teen (din) hain. (Bukhari: 3933)"
"1598","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Agar Yahood mein se das mujh par imaan laaen to Yahood mujh par imaan laaengey. (Bukhari: 3941). Maghaazi ki kitaab. Usheera ka ghazwa."
